            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-ablation-sigma-max>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-halfmax-radius-cv-across-seeds>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-inhibitor-diffusion-sweep-lambda-end-nm>,
