            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-optical-readout-pearson-r>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-optical-readout-rmse>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-otsu-core-fraction>,
